段落 66:
文本内容: This thesis briefly summarizes the status of domestic and international research on medical device marketing, as well as related marketing theories. It analyzes the current situation of Company Y's development and the problems of its marketing strategy in China. It applies the STP theory to segment, select, and locate the target markets of Company Y as well as its products, based on the strategic objectives, it finds the suitable Company Y's marketing strategy. Using the 7Ps marketing theory to optimize the marketing strategy of Company Y in seven aspects, and to propose different levels of safeguards for the overall implementation and execution of the strategy.
